# Thirst for Knowledge: "Draw three cards. Then discard two cards unless you discard an artifact card." Bot1 draws Ornithopter,
# Island, Island, so there is an artifact card in the hand (it was drawn, so the draw happens before the discard is chosen)
# and the player chooses between discarding one artifact card and two cards. Taking the artifact option, an Island is not
# eligible (refusal beside the positive choice of the drawn Ornithopter). Only the Ornithopter goes. {2}{U} is paid exactly
# by three Moxen (the pool is empty after).

